    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d188-a2">

                <pb facs="0277" n="173" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg173"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Group to its
                            Representative at Peking.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 19, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We are today sending following telegram to other groups.</p>
                <p>[Here follows Inclosure 1.]</p>
                <p>Communicate to your colleagues and officially advise Chinese Government of our
                    withdrawal from negotiations for reorganization loan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. P. Morgan</hi> &amp; Co.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
